  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_7486.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Espadilla est&aacute; viviendo esta semana sus fiestas patronales y la noche de este martes, 19 de agosto,&nbsp;se ha juntado la devoci&oacute;n hacia la Virgen de los Desamparados, con la diversi&oacute;n de la cena de sobaquillo, los disfraces y un d&uacute;o musical.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7474.jpg\" alt=\"img_7474\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7475.jpg\" alt=\"img_7475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7477.jpg\" alt=\"img_7477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7478.jpg\" alt=\"img_7478\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7479.jpg\" alt=\"img_7479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7480.jpg\" alt=\"img_7480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7481.jpg\" alt=\"img_7481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7482.jpg\" alt=\"img_7482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/martesfiestasespadilla14/img_7483.jpg\" alt=\"img_7483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d